WEBVTT

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.240
Above you.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.240
Sorry for making you wait.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.310
Jeez!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.730
What were you doing?!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.680
I was just thinking about going home.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:15.820
What?

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.450
I was giving thanks.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.940
To the proof that I'm alive!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.400
--Stay down!
--Get off!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.610
--Hey, Sophie. Do you wanna go somewhere?
--Sweets Donut came out with a new donut!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.030
I'll pass, today.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.540
You're looking for that guy again?

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.700
At Nail Color, our top
nailist will find that perf--

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.050
Moon Wizard.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.590
I got in?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:24.800
Really?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.690
That's not good.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.310
Weren't you wandering
around here last night, too?

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.400
This isn't a place where kids
like you should be wandering at night.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.150
Does your mommy and daddy know?

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.240
You should listen when adults talk to you!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.020
Sword.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.800
My master, Moon Wizard,

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:59.440
has chosen you among
the many candidates tonight.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:02.660
Your troubles, what you're
looking for, and all your desires...

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:07.740
He will help by reading
the light of the moon and stars.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.690
Welcome, Sophie Heness.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:00.580
Um, for the divination
today I want to, well... I...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.080
I know.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.460
You're looking for someone aren't you?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:09.300
You can't hide anything from me.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:13.760
You've worked hard for many years,
searching for that person.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:17.430
You learned self-defense
and collected information.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.640
And now...

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.810
You've come to me.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.190
Don't worry.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.230
I will show you your future.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.400
As well as the path to Eldorado.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.720
How did you know?!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.520
You have such beautiful hair.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.270
Red is the color of passion and desire.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:48.090
It burns the soul and excites the blood.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.630
It also awakens a savage wildness.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.630
U-Um...

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.130
I just want to eat you up.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:08.190
I want to eat you! Let me eat you!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.170
Let me eat you!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:06.210
Let me eat you!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.260
Time for some fun.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.020
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.590
U-Um...

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:45.730
Steak or tacos. Which do you like?

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:16.280
Um...

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:19.400
What was that?

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.720
Just now.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.720
The Moon Wizard was a monster.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:30.430
His fortune telling is really accurate,

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.890
but he's finicky and rarely meets others.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:38.320
I thought I finally won a reservation, but...

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.150
They're Horrors.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:41.740
Horrors?

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.740
Monsters that appear from Makai.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.660
Greed. Envy. Hatred. Despair.

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:53.870
People trapped by that darkness
allow themselves to become Horrors

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.040
and wander the nights searching
for other humans to consume.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:09.100
Still no leads on the 
serial girl kidnappings.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:13.640
17 victims. All the victims
were girls who had red hair.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:14.770
Perhaps the work of a psychotic...

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.190
He's the one behind it all.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.900
He always targets red haired women.

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:25.720
And he refuses to give up
on prey he sets his eyes on.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.700
I'll protect you.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.190
I am "one who protects"...

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.330
A Makai Knight...

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.210
...that destroys Horrors.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.460
Thanks for waiting!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.720
Another eye-pleasing day.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.470
I'll sue you for sexual harassment.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.110
A message from the boss.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.270
"Eat and get back to work."

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.650
Thanks for your business!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.310
Hurry up and eat.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.950
Time for my next appointment.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.030
Appointment?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.300
A date with a Horror.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.760
Hey.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.680
H-Hey...Wait!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:33.460
He'll definitely be back.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.020
He'll wait until you're alone.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.580
There's no saving you if I don't defeat him.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.740
But, this area won't work.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.380
Work with me a little.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.740
I won't let him lay a hand on you.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.590
In other words, you'll be bait.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.050
Zaruba.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:08.760
Well...

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.760
This guy may be stupid, 
but he has the skills.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:14.640
Getting on board here,
should be the better option for you.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.600
He's my partner.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.150
He talks too much, but he's pretty useful.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.650
So, what'll you do?

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.780
As well as the path to Eldorado.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.480
Protect me, no matter what.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.010
I'm the best Makai Knight there is.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:37.910
I'm Sword.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.060
Sophie.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.790
Got you!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.890
Do you know of Eldorado?

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:58.990
Eldorado?

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:04.160
Someone of your level
could never reach Eldorado!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.710
Crap!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:26.310
Zaruba!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:22.870
Don't move.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.410
U-Um!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.320
--The hell!
--Run!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.200
Oops!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.920
Your night ends here!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.230
Sword?

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.210
What in the world?

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.490
That idiot.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.340
Are you all right?

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.470
Why are you in a place like that?

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.860
Are you alone?
Where are your parents or friends?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.480
Do you know of Eldorado?

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:38.770
Your night ends here!

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:43.400
Makai Knight, Sword.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.490
Looks like the Eldorado lead was no good.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.790
Well, in the end, they're just murderers.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.770
We'll take our time.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.490
There's never an end to Horrors here.

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.710
I guess I should eat something and sleep.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:01.670
No, wait...

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:05.300
Even if you pick up a woman,
don't let her ride me.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.800
My seat starts stinking of make-up.

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:11.310
I didn't say anything, yet.
